+LD_PRELOAD=/tmp/audit-work/proc-self-shim.so \
+  lake env lean /tmp/audit-work/operational-checks-151.lean
+
+LD_PRELOAD=/tmp/audit-work/proc-self-shim.so \
+  lake env lean /tmp/audit-work/counterfactual-target-151.lean
+```
+
+Results:
